 evolve as he witnesses the joy and familial love associated with the holiday, marking a shift in his character."', 'weight': 95.0, 'source_id': 'chunk-91614df5cb74cbe5e109a338a82041e9<SEP>chunk-8f738cb25d60a7dab782162d9d0a25ed<SEP>chunk-e7637ff18c5ded77a68cce0a87883fad<SEP>chunk-8590d9263cd2cd4fa583c432fc54e6c3<SEP>chunk-54bdd22db1f84a965b5f4c06c9216d8d<SEP>chunk-90d5764e301321c087f5a8f78b73a145<SEP>chunk-da2472b4ef2a535b62908f14d0fb0ca9<SEP>chunk-94bea83e7153fc2064aa382b494936a1<SEP>chunk-89777b838d5447c7bd1ec11282c4ee89<SEP>chunk-99b0ec7f7e006561352b5d65e849611d<SEP>chunk-74e2466de2f67fd710ef2f20c0a8d9e0'}>
