 and is depicted as a friendly figure during the Christmas gathering."', 'source_id': 'chunk-94bea83e7153fc2064aa382b494936a1<SEP>chunk-9e3921da66da5d761ab73cd849af6c43<SEP>chunk-89777b838d5447c7bd1ec11282c4ee89<SEP>chunk-8f738cb25d60a7dab782162d9d0a25ed<SEP>chunk-e7637ff18c5ded77a68cce0a87883fad'}>
