2024-10-30 06:44:27,060 - lightrag - INFO - get_node:query:MATCH (n:`MARLEY'S GHOST`) RETURN n:result:<Node element_id='4:f7975480-d141-4db9-8802-4f1711f3c066:61' labels=frozenset({"MARLEY'S GHOST"}) properties={'entity_type': '"EVENT"', 'description': '"Marley\'s Ghost is a spectral figure that represents Scrooge\'s past partner who has returned to convey a message, encapsulating themes of guilt and redemption."<SEP>"Marley\'s Ghost is a spectral figure that represents Scrooge\'s past partner who has returned to convey a message, encapsulating themes of guilt and redemption."<SEP>"Marley\'s Ghost is a spectral figure that represents Scrooge\'s past partner who has returned to convey a message, encapsulating themes of guilt and redemption."<SEP>"Marley\'s Ghost is a spectral figure that represents Scrooge\'s past partner who has returned to convey a message, encapsulating themes of guilt and redemption."<SEP>"Marley\'s Ghost is a spectral figure who appears to Scrooge to warn him of the impending visits from three spirits, representing remorse for his past deeds."<SEP>"Marley\'s Ghost is a spectral visitation that deeply troubles Scrooge and causes him great perplexity, leading him to question the reality of his experiences."<SEP>"Marley\'s Ghost represents the supernatural apparition of Marley, who has been dead for seven years and symbolizes regret and warning to Scrooge."<SEP>"Marley\'s Ghost is an unearthly visitor that appears to Scrooge, causing him to question the nature of reality and dreams."<SEP>"Marley\'s Ghost is the spectral figure of Jacob Marley, who appears to forewarn Scrooge about his fate and the necessity of change in his life."<SEP>"Marley\'s Ghost is an unearthly visitor that appears to Scrooge, causing him to question the nature of reality and dreams."<SEP>"Marley\'s Ghost is the spectral figure of Jacob Marley, who appears to forewarn Scrooge about his fate and the necessity of change in his life."<SEP>"Marley\'s Ghost is an unearthly visitor that appears to Scrooge, causing him to question the nature of reality and dreams."<SEP>"Marley\'s Ghost is the spectral figure of Jacob Marley, who appears to forewarn Scrooge about his fate and the necessity of change in his life."<SEP>"Marley\'s Ghost is an unearthly visitor that appears to Scrooge, causing him to question the nature of reality and dreams."<SEP>"Marley\'s Ghost is the spectral figure of Jacob Marley, who appears to forewarn Scrooge about his fate and the necessity of change in his life."', 'source_id': 'chunk-1aa50206d02ed89418f65f97c6441d1c<SEP>chunk-cb661c37436355ccec2769b1d0350c5f<SEP>chunk-c7b10789a9cb0af6c553730b29bd9034<SEP>chunk-9c43dac2fcd5b578242d907ea6f8fc7b'}>
