2024-10-30 06:49:44,633 - lightrag - INFO - get_node:query:MATCH (n:`THE CLOCK`) RETURN n:result:<Node element_id='4:f7975480-d141-4db9-8802-4f1711f3c066:98' labels=frozenset({'THE CLOCK'}) properties={'entity_type': '"GEO"', 'description': '"The Clock is a device that malfunctions, contributing to Scrooge\'s confusion about time and reality in the narrative."<SEP>"The Clock is mentioned as malfunctioning, which symbolizes the confusion and distortion of time that Scrooge experiences during his nighttime visitations."<SEP>"The Clock serves as a symbol of time passing, reflecting Scrooge\'s disorientation regarding time as he transitions between reality and the supernatural."<SEP>"The Clock signifies the passage of time during the Domestic Ball and plays a role in marking the end of the celebration."<SEP>"The Clock serves as a symbol of time passing, reflecting Scrooge\'s disorientation regarding time as he transitions between reality and the supernatural."<SEP>"The Clock signifies the passage of time during the Domestic Ball and plays a role in marking the end of the celebration."<SEP>"The Clock serves as a symbol of time passing, reflecting Scrooge\'s disorientation regarding time as he transitions between reality and the supernatural."<SEP>"The Clock signifies the passage of time during the Domestic Ball and plays a role in marking the end of the celebration."<SEP>"The Clock serves as a symbol of time passing, reflecting Scrooge\'s disorientation regarding time as he transitions between reality and the supernatural."<SEP>"The Clock signifies the passage of time during the Domestic Ball and plays a role in marking the end of the celebration."<SEP>"The Clock serves as a symbol of time passing, reflecting Scrooge\'s disorientation regarding time as he transitions between reality and the supernatural."<SEP>"The Clock signifies the passage of time during the Domestic Ball and plays a role in marking the end of the celebration."', 'source_id': 'chunk-c7b10789a9cb0af6c55