aching Scrooge valuable lessons about kindness and the Christmas spirit."<SEP>"The Ghost of Christmas Present is a spirit that reveals the current struggles and joys of others, influencing Scrooge\'s perspective."', 'source_id': 'chunk-843b5b2f944c7413d9ca876e2e2f151f<SEP>chunk-9e3921da66da5d761ab73cd849af6c43'}>
