2024-10-30 06:53:22,839 - lightrag - INFO - get_edge:query:
            MATCH (start:`BOB CRATCHIT`)-[r]->(end:`TINY TIM`)
            RETURN properties(r) as edge_properties
            LIMIT 1
            :result:{'keywords': '"family bond, care"<SEP>"family bond, father-son relationship"<SEP>"family bond, love"<SEP>"family love, vulnerability"<SEP>"family, care"<SEP>"family, caregiving"<SEP>"family, love struggles"<SEP>"family, struggle"<SEP>"family, support"<SEP>"father-son bond, care"<SEP>"father-son relationship, care"<SEP>"parental love, sorrow"<SEP>"parenting, hope"', 'weight': 119.0, 'description': '"Bob Cratchit deeply cares for Tiny Tim, demonstrating emotional support and love, especially in moments of distress."<SEP>"Bob Cratchit expresses love and concern for his son Tiny Tim during the Christmas dinner, highlighting a strong familial bond."<SEP>"Bob Cratchit is Tiny Tim\'s father, and the turkey Scrooge plans to send will impact Tiny Tim\'s well-being."<SEP>"Bob Cratchit is Tiny Tim\'s father, and their relationship highlights the theme of family struggle and love, especially during Christmas."<SEP>"Bob Cratchit shows deep care for Tiny Tim, helping him and expressing pride in his strength and character despite challenges."<SEP>"Bob Cratchit\'s concern for Tiny Tim illustrates the deep familial love and the challenges facing the Cratchit family."<SEP>"Bob Cratchit is a father figure to Tiny Tim, who carries both hope and concern for his child\'s future health and well-being."<SEP>"Bob Cratchit is the father of Tiny Tim, showcasing familial love and challenges faced by the Cratchit family."<SEP>"Bob Cratchit is the father of Tiny Tim, showing the importance of family dynamics and care in their lives."<SEP>"Bob Cratchit shows affection for Tiny Tim, often expressing concern for his health and trying to keep him close during the Christmas celebration."<SEP>"Bob Cratchit shows deep care for Tiny Tim, supporting him and expressing pride in his resilience, especially regarding Tiny Tim\'s reflective thoughts on Christmas."<SEP>"Bob Cratchit shows deep concern and love for his son, Tiny Tim, highlighting the family dynamics and attachment in their household."<SEP>"Bob Cratchit shows deep love and sorrow for Tiny Tim, reflecting a father\'s bond with his child."<SEP>"Bob is the father of Tiny Tim, who requires support and care, emphasizing themes of family and responsibility."', 'source_id': 'chunk-90b95db5c53e4364a6bee36b7aa4d70f<SEP>chunk-503f0bfa5453467c7c61d160a3540eca<SEP>chunk-91572b3cd42786ba4cb2f180ca25cbf4<SEP>chunk-9e3921da66da5d761ab73cd849af6c43<SEP>chunk-94bea83e7153fc2064aa382b494936a1<SEP>chunk-83ac129dc9b56f84c46760d153d68e93<SEP>chunk-7e2e7ebcc19a53b399dc03aded4743e7<SEP>chunk-1d4b58de5429cd1261370c231c8673e8'}
