2024-10-30 06:54:23,720 - lightrag - INFO - get_node:query:MATCH (n:`THE GHOST OF CHRISTMAS YET TO COME`) RETURN n:result:<Node element_id='4:f7975480-d141-4db9-8802-4f1711f3c066:325' labels=frozenset({'THE GHOST OF CHRISTMAS YET TO COME'}) properties={'entity_type': '"ORGANIZATION"', 'description': '"The Ghost of Christmas Yet to Come is a spectral being that guides Scrooge through visions of his potential future."<SEP>"The Ghost of Christmas Yet to Come is a spirit that shows Scrooge the consequences of his actions, pointing toward his eventual demise."<SEP>"The Ghost of Christmas Yet to Come reveals the potential consequences of Scrooge\'s current life choices, emphasizing themes of mortality and legacy."<SEP>"The Ghost of Christmas Yet to Come is a spirit that shows Scrooge the consequences of his actions, pointing toward his eventual demise."<SEP>"The Ghost of Christmas Yet to Come reveals the potential consequences of Scrooge\'s current life choices, emphasizing themes of mortality and legacy."<SEP>"The Ghost of Christmas Yet to Come is a spirit that shows Scrooge the consequences of his actions, pointing toward his eventual demise."<SEP>"The Ghost of Christmas Yet to Come reveals the potential consequences of Scrooge\'s current life choices, emphasizing themes of mortality and legacy."<SEP>"The Ghost of Christmas Yet to Come is a spirit that shows Scrooge the consequences of his actions, pointing toward his eventual demise."<SEP>"The Ghost of Christmas Yet to Come reveals the potential consequences of Scrooge\'s current life choices, emphasizing themes of mortality and legacy."<SEP>"The Ghost of Christmas Yet to Come is a spirit that shows Scrooge the consequences of his actions, pointing toward his eventual demise."<SEP>"The Ghost of Christmas Yet to Come reveals the potential consequences of Scrooge\'s current life choices, emphasizing themes of mortality and legacy."', 'source_id': 'chunk-91572b3cd42786ba4cb2f180ca25cbf4<SEP>chunk-90b95db5c53e4364a6bee36b7